// Button to initialize a Git repository
// en: "Initialize Repository"
"initialize-repository.action.submit" = "初始化儲存庫";

// Button to initialize a Git repository in a specific folder
// en: "Initialize Repository in "%@""
"initialize-repository.action.submit-with-folder" = "在「%@」初始化儲存庫";

// Text explaining the concept of a Git repository folder
// en: "**Choose which folder should become a Git repository from the list on the left.** Typically, the Git repository is the folder of your project. Files inside the repository folder are tracked for changes by Git, including files in nested folders."
"initialize-repository.description.choose-repository-folder" = "**從左側列表中選擇哪個資料夾應該成為 Git 儲存庫。** 通常，Git 儲存庫是您專案的資料夾。儲存庫資料夾內的檔案都會被 Git 追蹤變更，包括子資料夾中的檔案。";

// Text explaining what happens after initializing a Git repository
// en: "After the repository has been initialized, Light Table will create an initial version. From that moment forward, changes to files in the repository are tracked by Git."
"initialize-repository.description.post-initialization" = "儲存庫初始化後，Light Table 將建立初始版本。從那時起，儲存庫中檔案的變更會被 Git 追蹤。";

// Title explaining that the Git software is the industry standard for managing versions of files.
// en: "Git is the industry standard version control system."
"initialize-repository.title.git-is-industry-standard" = "Git 是業界標準的版本控制系統。";

// Title explaining that Light Table is based on Git with placeholders ("<...>") that get replaced by images.
